  "body": "Brand new and finished to an exceptional standard, 24A Sierra Street presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a beautifully crafted home in one of the Eastern Bays' most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nBuilt by the respected team at Assure Build and complemented by beautifully curated interiors from Yellowfox, this contemporary residence has been thoughtfully designed for effortless modern living. Light-filled open-plan spaces are enhanced by premium finishes, a bespoke kitchen with stone benchtops and quality appliances, creating a timeless aesthetic that will appeal for years to come.\r\n\r\nOffering three generous bedrooms, two stylish bathrooms and a separate powder room, the well-considered layout strikes the perfect balance between comfort, functionality and low-maintenance living. A sunny west-facing aspect, excellent storage and seamless indoor-outdoor flow further enhance the home's everyday appeal.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your first home, a lock-and-leave lifestyle or a quality investment in a premium location, this home offers an exceptional opportunity just moments from St Heliers Village, the beach and the green open spaces of Churchill Park.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Brand-new home backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n• Built by trusted local specialists Assure Build\r\n• Three generous bedrooms, two bathrooms and a separate powder room\r\n• Designer kitchen with stone benchtops and premium appliances\r\n• Beautifully curated interiors by Yellowfox\r\n• Sunny west-facing aspect with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Excellent storage and low-maintenance, lock-and-leave living\r\n• Zoned for St Heliers School and Glendowie College, both within a 10-minute walk\r\n• Walking distance to St Heliers Village, the beach and local parks\r\n\r\nCombining exceptional craftsmanship, contemporary design and an unbeatable lifestyle location, 24A Sierra Street is a home you'll be proud to own for years to come.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this one! Call to arrange your private viewing today.",
